{"id":"ddd71b28b9e13b9b","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-double-negation-booleanization.md","title":"Theorem — 双重否定拓扑与 Boolean 化","display":"Theorem — 双重否定拓扑与 Boolean 化","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-double-negation-booleanization","aliases":["14-thm-double-negation-booleanization"],"display":"Theorem — 双重否定拓扑与 Boolean 化","source_ref":"V.1, pp.218–222; VI.1, Theorem 3, pp.272–273","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-thm-power-object-classification]]","[[14-df-heyting-negation]]","[[14-df-boolean-topos]]","[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]]","[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category]]","[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]","[[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-double-negation-booleanization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-double-negation-booleanization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 双重否定拓扑与 Boolean 化"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"V.1, pp.218–222; VI.1, Theorem 3, pp.272–273"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f47f9749d4510aa\" href=\"?note=2f47f9749d4510aa\" title=\"14-thm-power-object-classification\">14-thm-power-object-classification</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c\" href=\"?note=42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c\" title=\"14-df-heyting-negation\">14-df-heyting-negation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"78d84752064c9948\" href=\"?note=78d84752064c9948\" title=\"14-df-boolean-topos\">14-df-boolean-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" href=\"?note=4b8f9443a0ee72c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"389620cd4ca5e1c6\" href=\"?note=389620cd4ca5e1c6\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f2ca2aad80752c90\" href=\"?note=f2ca2aad80752c90\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9135c45b14ec366c\" href=\"?note=9135c45b14ec366c\" title=\"14-df-j-sheaf-object\">14-df-j-sheaf-object</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯，指定分类子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,t:1\\to\\Omega)\">\\((\\Omega,t:1\\to\\Omega)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf T=[t]\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathsf T=[t]\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{\\Omega}\">\\(\\chi_{\\Omega}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2f47f9749d4510aa\" href=\"?note=2f47f9749d4510aa\" title=\"14-thm-power-object-classification\">14-thm-power-object-classification</a> 的分类对应。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg:\\Omega\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\neg:\\Omega\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 由下式构造。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(A)\">\\(S\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg S\">\\(\\neg S\\)</span> 简写 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c\" href=\"?note=42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c\" title=\"14-df-heyting-negation\">14-df-heyting-negation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Neg}_A(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Neg}_A(S)\\)</span>，不同于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 箭头本身。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 层满子范畴。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\coloneqq\\chi_{\\Omega}(\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\Omega}(\\mathsf T)),\\qquad j\\coloneqq\\neg\\circ\\neg,\\qquad\\operatorname{IsLTTopology}(j),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsBoolean}(\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\coloneqq\\chi_{\\Omega}(\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\Omega}(\\mathsf T)),\\qquad j\\coloneqq\\neg\\circ\\neg,\\qquad\\operatorname{IsLTTopology}(j),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsBoolean}(\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall S,T\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(A)\\;(S\\le\\neg\\neg S\\land\\neg\\neg\\neg\\neg S=\\neg\\neg S\\land\\neg\\neg(S\\wedge T)=\\neg\\neg S\\wedge\\neg\\neg T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall S,T\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(A)\\;(S\\le\\neg\\neg S\\land\\neg\\neg\\neg\\neg S=\\neg\\neg S\\land\\neg\\neg(S\\wedge T)=\\neg\\neg S\\wedge\\neg\\neg T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Heyting 代数的伪补伴随给出扩张性、幂等性和保持有限交；这些是双重否定闭包的核公理。拉回保持 Heyting 否定，故闭包对换基自然，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 上的 Lawvere–Tierney 拓扑。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 层的子层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>，它在环境拓扑斯中为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 闭子对象，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\neg S=S\">\\(\\neg\\neg S=S\\)</span>。层子拓扑斯内的交不变、并为环境并的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 闭包，否定为环境否定再闭包；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\neg\\neg=\\neg\">\\(\\neg\\neg\\neg=\\neg\\)</span> 使内部双重否定仍等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>。由 Boolean 判别得到结论。这里没有把环境拓扑斯的任意子对象都误称为双重否定闭对象。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，V.1, pp.218–222; VI.1, Theorem 3, pp.272–273。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-thm-power-object-classification","status":"resolved","id":"2f47f9749d4510aa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-power-object-classification]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-heyting-negation","status":"resolved","id":"42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-heyting-negation]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-boolean-topos","status":"resolved","id":"78d84752064c9948","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-boolean-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology","status":"resolved","id":"4b8f9443a0ee72c6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"389620cd4ca5e1c6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure","status":"resolved","id":"f2ca2aad80752c90","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-sheaf-object","status":"resolved","id":"9135c45b14ec366c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-power-object-classification","status":"resolved","id":"2f47f9749d4510aa","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，指定分类子 $(\\Omega,t:1\\to\\Omega)$。$\\mathsf T=[t]\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega)$，$\\chi_{\\Omega}$ 是 [[14-thm-power-object-classification]] 的分类对应。$\\neg:\\Omega\\to\\Omega$ 与 $j$ 由下式构造。对 $S\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(A)$，$\\neg S$ 简写 [[14-df-heyting-negation]] 的 $\\mathrm{Neg}_A(S)$，不同于 $\\Omega$ 箭头本身。$\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)$ 为 $j$ 层满子范畴。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-heyting-negation","status":"resolved","id":"42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，指定分类子 $(\\Omega,t:1\\to\\Omega)$。$\\mathsf T=[t]\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega)$，$\\chi_{\\Omega}$ 是 [[14-thm-power-object-classification]] 的分类对应。$\\neg:\\Omega\\to\\Omega$ 与 $j$ 由下式构造。对 $S\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(A)$，$\\neg S$ 简写 [[14-df-heyting-negation]] 的 $\\mathrm{Neg}_A(S)$，不同于 $\\Omega$ 箭头本身。$\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)$ 为 $j$ 层满子范畴。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"(\\Omega,t:1\\to\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf T=[t]\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_{\\Omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg:\\Omega\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"S\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Neg}_A(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\coloneqq\\chi_{\\Omega}(\\mathrm{Neg}_{\\Omega}(\\mathsf T)),\\qquad j\\coloneqq\\neg\\circ\\neg,\\qquad\\operatorname{IsLTTopology}(j),\\qquad\\operatorname{IsBoolean}(\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\;\\forall S,T\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(A)\\;(S\\le\\neg\\neg S\\land\\neg\\neg\\neg\\neg S=\\neg\\neg S\\land\\neg\\neg(S\\wedge T)=\\neg\\neg S\\wedge\\neg\\neg T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\neg S=S","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\neg\\neg=\\neg","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":2547,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-185","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-double-negation-booleanization|thm-222 — 双重否定拓扑与 Boolean 化]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-double-negation-booleanization]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-254","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-double-negation-booleanization]]"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-double-negation-booleanization]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-176","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-double-negation-booleanization]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-186","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-double-negation-booleanization|thm-222 — 双重否定拓扑与 Boolean 化]]"}],"outgoing":["2f47f9749d4510aa","42b2e2d4b9f8fe9c","78d84752064c9948","4b8f9443a0ee72c6","389620cd4ca5e1c6","f2ca2aad80752c90","9135c45b14ec366c"]}